@startuml use-cases-intake-review
' Use cases: incoming-document screening, staff review side (review queue, student data,
' docs/intake/screening-contract.md). Detail of the "intake" package in use-cases.puml; the
' station side is use-cases-intake.puml.
'
' "' @routes <alias>: <METHOD path> | ..." lists the API routes behind a use case.
' backend/tests/test_use_case_diagram.py checks every actor link against
' backend/tests/test_access_matrix.py: edit both together.
' A use case that <<extend>>s another is also performed by that use case's actors.
title DocuSense use cases: incoming-document screening (staff review)
left to right direction
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #F4F8FC
  BorderColor #2F5D8A
}
skinparam actor {
  BorderColor #2F5D8A
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  BorderColor #B8A200
}

actor "Registrar" as Registrar
actor "Administrator" as Admin

rectangle "DocuSense" {
  package "Incoming-document screening" {
    usecase "Work the review queue\n(page image, reasons)" as I_QUEUE
    ' @routes I_QUEUE: GET /api/intake/documents | GET /api/intake/documents/{intake_id} | GET /api/intake/documents/{intake_id}/image
    usecase "Accept, reject or\nrequest resubmission" as I_REVIEW
    ' @routes I_REVIEW: POST /api/intake/documents/{intake_id}/review
    usecase "Review extracted\nstudent data" as I_FIELDS
    ' @routes I_FIELDS: GET /api/intake/documents/{intake_id}/fields | PUT /api/intake/documents/{intake_id}/fields
    usecase "Link to a student profile\n(candidates are suggestions;\nunlink)" as I_LINK
    ' @routes I_LINK: GET /api/intake/documents/{intake_id}/candidates | POST /api/intake/documents/{intake_id}/link | POST /api/intake/documents/{intake_id}/unlink
    usecase "Create a student profile\nfrom the document" as I_CREATE
    ' @routes I_CREATE: POST /api/intake/documents/{intake_id}/create-student
  }
}

Registrar -- I_QUEUE
Registrar -- I_FIELDS
Admin -- I_QUEUE
Admin -- I_FIELDS

I_QUEUE <.. I_REVIEW : <<extend>>
I_FIELDS <.. I_LINK : <<extend>>
I_FIELDS <.. I_CREATE : <<extend>>

note as N1
  A reason is required to reject, to request
  resubmission and to accept a flagged document,
  and to link on a match that is not strong.
  Only passed or accepted documents reach
  student data review.
end note
@enduml
